    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GVM are delighted to introduce No. 51 Elm Road to the market, a spacious and beautifully presented four-bedroom home situated in one of Limerick`s most sought-after residential locations of Annacotty, which nestles along the banks of the meandering Mulcair River and is renowned for its attractive riverside setting, scenic walkways and welcoming village atmosphere.\n\n The surrounding locality offers an outstanding range of amenities, including excellent shops, restaurants, coffee shops and renowned local hostelries. Families are particularly well catered for, with a wonderful selection of educational facilities nearby, including Castletroy College, highly regarded primary schools and a local Gaelscoil.\n\nThe University of Limerick and Plassey Technological Park are also within easy reach, making this an ideal location for professionals, families and investors alike. An impressive selection of sporting and recreational facilities is available locally, including Castletroy Golf Club, UL Bohemian RFC, Aisling Annacotty FC and Monaleen GAA Club. Newtown Recreation Park and the nearby Greenway provide further opportunities for walking, cycling and outdoor recreation.\n\nPresented in very good condition throughout, the property has been freshly painted and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation ideal for families, first-time buyers or those seeking a home in a convenient and established neighbourhood.\n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a comfortable living room with an open fireplace, and a generous kitchen/dining area fitted with new appliances. Double doors connect the dining area with the rear garden, providing an abundance of natural light and creating an excellent space for everyday family living and entertaining.\n\nUpstairs, there are four bedrooms, three of which are doubles. Each bedroom benefits from a built-in wardrobe, while the two larger bedrooms have private en-suite facilities. The main bedroom is particularly spacious, with large windows creating a bright and inviting atmosphere.\n\nWith its generous accommodation, fresh presentation and prominent Limerick location,\n\n No. 51 Elm Road represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial, turn key family home.\n\nAccommodation\n\n\nEntrance Hallway 3.5m x 1.9m\n - Bright and welcoming entrance hallway with laminate flooring.\n\nLiving Room 5.5m x 3.2m\n - Comfortable reception room featuring laminate flooring and an open fireplace.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area 5.1m x 3.5m\n - Spacious kitchen and dining area with tiled flooring and new appliances. Double doors open onto the rear garden.\n\nFirst-floor landing - \nCarpeted stairs leading to the bedroom accommodation.\n\nBedroom One 2.5m x 2.4m - \nSingle bedroom with a built-in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom Two 3.2m x 2.5m - \nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring and a built-in wardrobe.\n\nMain Bathroom 2.2m x 1.9m\n\nBedroom Three - 5.2 x 4.5 - \nGenerous double bedroom with carpet flooring and a built-in wardrobe. Glazed sliding doors allow additional natural light into the room. En-suite off 2.3m x 1.1m \nfitted with a new electric shower. \n\nBedroom Four 6.2m x 4.0m - \nExceptionally spacious double bedroom with carpet flooring, a built in wardrobe and large windows providing excellent natural light. En-suite off 2.5m x 1.2m\n\n"
      },
      {
