        "Content": "<ul><li> Two car park spaces in widened front driveway </li><li> Walled in rear garden with good orientation for the sun </li><li> Newly painted and very well presented </li><li> Gas fired heating with new gas boiler fitted in 2023 </li><li> Some appliances included </li><li> Security alarm </li><li> New electric shower fitted in 2023 </li><li> Rear sensor light and outside tap </li><li> No chain and ready for immediate occupation </li><li> Double glazed uPVC windows</li></ul>"
